---
kind: lore
id: spine.radio
title: Radio Verdane
---

// The morning programme, once a day, before the day's own events.
<beat id="morningNews" on="dayStart" title="Morning news" priority="100" once="day">
  @announcer{code="0010"}: Good morning, Verdane! It's {{clock.weekdayLabel}}, the {{run.day:ordinalWord}} day of the season.
  @announcer{code="0020" when="@contestDay"}: The Wildmoor bug-catching contest runs today at the Preserve. Bring your best net!
  @announcer{code="0030" when="@weekend"}: It's the weekend, so the Silvercrest Department Store is open late.
</beat>
